<title>SPAIN: No plans so far for KLM Madrid cargo rates.</title>
<headline>No plans so far for KLM Madrid cargo rates.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch flag carrier KLM Royal Dutch Airlines NV has no plans so far to raise cargo rates from Madrid early next year, an airline spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;Head office has not told us anything yet,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Late yesterday KLM said it plans an increase of 1O to 12 percent in ex-Germany air cargo rates in first quarter 1997.</p>
<p>Earlier today a KLM cargo official said he expected a similar sized increase for ex-Paris air cargo during the first quarter. --Air Cargo Newsroom -Tel+44-171-542-7706  Fax+44-171-542-5107</p>
